UID:da43dc2c-00af-4cc1-8ef1-90a60b2eb9e5@spacex.wpditzy
DTSTAMP:20260905T235451Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260905T235451Z
SUMMARY:🚀 SpaceX｜SDA Tranche 1 Transport Layer A（暂定）
LOCATION:Space Launch Complex 4E / Vandenberg SFB\, CA\, USA
DESCRIPTION:运载器：Falcon 9 Block 5\n状态：To Be Determined\n时间精度：Month\n任务：Tra
 nche 1 Transport Layer A is one of six missions by the United States Spa
 ce Force Space Development Agency (SDA) for the Proliferated Warfighter 
 Space Architecture (PWSA) Tranche 1 Transport Layer constellation\, whic
 h will provide assured\, resilient\, low-latency military data and conne
 ctivity worldwide to the full range of warfighter platforms from Low Ear
 th Orbit satellites.\n\nThe constellation will be interconnected with Op
 tical Inter-Satellite Links (OISLs) which have significantly increased p
 erformance over existing radio frequency crosslinks. It is expected to o
 perate over Ka band\, have stereo coverage and be dynamically networked 
 for simpler hand-offs\, greater bandwidth and fault tolerance.\n\nThis l
 aunch carries 21 satellites manufactured by Northrop Grumman.\n发射窗口（UTC）
 ：2026-09-30T00:00:00Z – 2026-09-30T00:00:00Z\n数据源：Launch Library 2 / The
  Space Devs\n详情：https://ll.thespacedevs.com/2.2.0/launch/da43dc2c-00af-4
 cc1-8ef1-90a60b2eb9e5/?format=json
URL:https://ll.thespacedevs.com/2.2.0/launch/da43dc2c-00af-4cc1-8ef1-90a6
 0b2eb9e5/?format=json
STATUS:TENTATIVE
