 ：Tranche 1 Transport Layer D is one of six missions by the United States
  Space Force Space Development Agency (SDA) for the Proliferated Warfigh
 ter Space Architecture (PWSA) Tranche 1 Transport Layer constellation\, 
 which will provide assured\, resilient\, low-latency military data and c
 onnectivity worldwide to the full range of warfighter platforms from Low
  Earth Orbit satellites.\n\nThe constellation will be interconnected wit
 h Optical Inter-Satellite Links (OISLs) which have significantly increas
 ed performance over existing radio frequency crosslinks. It is expected 
 to operate over Ka band\, have stereo coverage and be dynamically networ
 ked for simpler hand-offs\, greater bandwidth and fault tolerance.\n发射窗口
 （UTC）：2026-12-31T00:00:00Z – 2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\n数据源：Launch Library 2 
