 A's Near-Earth Object (NEO) Surveyor mission is designed to help advance
  planetary defense efforts to discover and characterize most of the pote
 ntially hazardous asteroids and comets that come within 30 million miles
  of Earth’s orbit. These are collectively known as near-earth objects\, 
 or NEOs.\n\nNEO Surveyor consists of a single scientific instrument: a 5
 0 centimeter (nearly 20 inch) diameter telescope that operates in two he
 at-sensing infrared wavelengths. It will be capable of detecting both br
 ight and dark asteroids\, which are the most difficult type to find.\n发射
 窗口（UTC）：2028-06-30T00:00:00Z – 2028-06-30T00:00:00Z\n数据源：Launch Library 
